  }
  /* Swap animation — same leave/enter recipe as .story-modal__body's
     own next/prev transition (see switchStory() in the script): rest
     state transitions opacity+transform, [data-leaving]/[data-entering]
     set the off-rest values the JS toggles around the actual
     hidden-attribute swap. Slower and eased-out (vs. story-modal__
     body's linear-ish 200ms ease) — same curve as the page's own
     .reveal-item fades — reads noticeably smoother for a small block
     like this; the JS's 320ms timeout matches this duration. cursor
